WEBVTT

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:32.976
"Why Kermit?" she said,
"Kermit the Frog means nothing to me."

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:38.111
You know, I was wondering about
Freudian determinants: Why Kermit?

00:09:38.135 --> 00:09:40.500
"Kermit the Frog means nothing to me."

00:09:40.524 --> 00:09:42.706
She didn't mind the cartoons too much.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.318
But what did disturb her

00:09:44.342 --> 00:09:48.912
was she got very persistent images
or hallucinations of faces,

00:09:48.936 --> 00:09:52.423
and as with Rosalie,
the faces were often deformed,

00:09:52.447 --> 00:09:55.585
with very large teeth or very large eyes.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.254
And these frightened her.

00:09:59.262 --> 00:10:03.040
Well, what is going on with these people?